    "notes": "No amounts are given or shown clearly: all quantities are my estimates. The transcript is garbled; I read the powders as roasted cumin powder and black salt from the speech plus the colours. The video starts with potatoes already boiled and rice already cooked. The first 11 seconds show the cook standing (no food close-up), so the potato and curd pictures are small crops. The moment of pouring the tadka into the bowl is not shown: those pictures show the finished tadka, then the lid going on.",
